  "question": {
    "text": "An oscillating <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>LC</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>circuit consists of a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>75</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mH</mi></math> inductor and a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#181;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math> capacitor. If the maximum charge to the capacitor is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#181;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>. The maximum current in the circuit will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>_______</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mA</mi></math>.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "9",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>When the capacitor is fully discharged,&nbsp;the current is maximum and all the energy resides in the inductor. Hence, the energy of the capacitor is equal to the energy of the inductor.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>L</mi><msub><msup><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><msup><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>m</mi></msub><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;is the maximum current and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;is the maximum charge.</p><p>The given values are&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math></p><p>The maximum current is found from equation (i)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><msqrt><mn>75</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mA</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
